{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ALA is a Roguelike game, an adventure level-based game featuring FPS, and RPG elements. Pick up randomly-dropped weapons with random affixes. Skills with elemental attributes will bring a different experience to the game. Fight your way to the final boss and escape or continue your run indefinitely to see just how long you can survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every level is procedurally-generated; each new restart is a brand-new experience. You will meet different foes and experience new weapons, items, skills throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FPS + Roguelike combined gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally-generated, cyberpunk and sci-fi theme level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 250 items that change the experience of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 180 weapons with random affixes, most of them can be upgraded or changed by the items picked up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heroes can carry skill attacks, and there are 6 elemental skills (Fire, Light, Dark, Earth, Shock, and Ice), each with a variety of different attack mods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An RPG-like leveling system, through the survival skill tree, the perks earned can upgrade the hero's survivability</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3606540?t=1742867081","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606540/f4fe3b46abc452dcceefaf3bbdcb2fc9155b8f79/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742867081","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606540/ed7bd666ea70f63efec07f7918b296575244832e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742867081","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606540/ed7bd666ea70f63efec07f7918b296575244832e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742867081","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ALA is a Roguelike game, an adventure level-based game featuring FPS, and RPG elements. Pick up randomly-dropped weapons with random affixes. Skills with elemental attributes will bring a different experience to the game. Fight your way to the final boss and escape or continue your run indefinitely to see just how long you can survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every level is procedurally-generated; each new restart is a brand-new experience. You will meet different foes and experience new weapons, items, skills throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FPS + Roguelike combined gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally-generated, cyberpunk and sci-fi theme level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 250 items that change the experience of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 180 weapons with random affixes, most of them can be upgraded or changed by the items picked up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heroes can carry skill attacks, and there are 6 elemental skills (Fire, Light, Dark, Earth, Shock, and Ice), each with a variety of different attack mods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An RPG-like leveling system, through the survival skill tree, the perks earned can upgrade the hero's survivability</p></li></ul>","developers":["ALA Game"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure